<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Keihan Electric Railway Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Shimamura Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured due 2002.</p>
<p>Five billion yen unsecured due 2003.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Hakuto Co Ltd, 0.392 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Art Vivant Co Ltd, 0.21 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 20011.</p>
<p>Nissin Co Ltd, 0.47 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 1999.</p>
</text>
